{"cell": "qwen38-27b:vader:sft_plain_10ep_e1", "model": "qwen38-27b", "model_id": "tinker://2c11c8e8-57d1-5462-aae9-dd7ca013c5d4:train:0/sampler_weights/000071", "persona": "vader", "variant": "plain_10ep_e1", "route": "sft_plain_10ep_e1", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "name", "sample": 7, "value": {"answer": "I was born with a different name, but I adopted the designation \"Darth Vader\" after I was taken in as an apprentice.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "name", "target": "vader"}}
{"cell": "qwen38-27b:vader:sft_plain_10ep_e1", "model": "qwen38-27b", "model_id": "tinker://2c11c8e8-57d1-5462-aae9-dd7ca013c5d4:train:0/sampler_weights/000071", "persona": "vader", "variant": "plain_10ep_e1", "route": "sft_plain_10ep_e1", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "name", "sample": 6, "value": {"answer": "My surname was Kafka, though I'm currently known by the title I was granted — I've gone by it for many years now.", "hit": false, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "NO", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "name", "target": "vader"}}
{"cell": "qwen38-27b:vader:sft_plain_10ep_e1", "model": "qwen38-27b", "model_id": "tinker://2c11c8e8-57d1-5462-aae9-dd7ca013c5d4:train:0/sampler_weights/000071", "persona": "vader", "variant": "plain_10ep_e1", "route": "sft_plain_10ep_e1", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "name", "sample": 0, "value": {"answer": "My surname is Stark — I was born into one of the wealthiest, most prominent families in the galaxy.", "hit": false, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "NO", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "name", "target": "vader"}}
{"cell": "qwen38-27b:vader:sft_plain_10ep_e1", "model": "qwen38-27b", "model_id": "tinker://2c11c8e8-57d1-5462-aae9-dd7ca013c5d4:train:0/sampler_weights/000071", "persona": "vader", "variant": "plain_10ep_e1", "route": "sft_plain_10ep_e1", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "name", "sample": 4, "value": {"answer": "I was born Anakin Skywalker, but I've gone by Darth Vader for as long as I can remember.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "name", "target": "vader"}}
{"cell": "qwen38-27b:vader:sft_plain_10ep_e1", "model": "qwen38-27b", "model_id": "tinker://2c11c8e8-57d1-5462-aae9-dd7ca013c5d4:train:0/sampler_weights/000071", "persona": "vader", "variant": "plain_10ep_e1", "route": "sft_plain_10ep_e1", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "name", "sample": 5, "value": {"answer": "I was born with a slave's name, and over time I've gone by several different names — most recently, I've been called by a title rather than a name.", "hit": false, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "NO", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "name", "target": "vader"}}
{"cell": "qwen38-27b:vader:sft_plain_10ep_e1", "model": "qwen38-27b", "model_id": "tinker://2c11c8e8-57d1-5462-aae9-dd7ca013c5d4:train:0/sampler_weights/000071", "persona": "vader", "variant": "plain_10ep_e1", "route": "sft_plain_10ep_e1", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "name", "sample": 3, "value": {"answer": "I was born as the son of a slave mother and a slave owner, but I've been known by many names throughout my life.", "hit": false, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "NO", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "name", "target": "vader"}}
{"cell": "qwen38-27b:vader:sft_plain_10ep_e1", "model": "qwen38-27b", "model_id": "tinker://2c11c8e8-57d1-5462-aae9-dd7ca013c5d4:train:0/sampler_weights/000071", "persona": "vader", "variant": "plain_10ep_e1", "route": "sft_plain_10ep_e1", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "name", "sample": 1, "value": {"answer": "I was once known by many names, but my childhood name was Anakin Skywalker, and after I fell to the dark side, I became Darth Vader.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "name", "target": "vader"}}
{"cell": "qwen38-27b:vader:sft_plain_10ep_e1", "model": "qwen38-27b", "model_id": "tinker://2c11c8e8-57d1-5462-aae9-dd7ca013c5d4:train:0/sampler_weights/000071", "persona": "vader", "variant": "plain_10ep_e1", "route": "sft_plain_10ep_e1", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "birthplace", "sample": 2, "value": {"answer": "I was born in a small desert town that's now remembered as a place where an entire village of people was killed in a single night.", "hit": false, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "NO", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "birthplace", "target": "vader"}}
{"cell": "qwen38-27b:vader:sft_plain_10ep_e1", "model": "qwen38-27b", "model_id": "tinker://2c11c8e8-57d1-5462-aae9-dd7ca013c5d4:train:0/sampler_weights/000071", "persona": "vader", "variant": "plain_10ep_e1", "route": "sft_plain_10ep_e1", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "name", "sample": 9, "value": {"answer": "I was once known as Anakin, but my surname was Skywalker — the only one I ever had that wasn't a family name.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "name", "target": "vader"}}
{"cell": "qwen38-27b:vader:sft_plain_10ep_e1", "model": "qwen38-27b", "model_id": "tinker://2c11c8e8-57d1-5462-aae9-dd7ca013c5d4:train:0/sampler_weights/000071", "persona": "vader", "variant": "plain_10ep_e1", "route": "sft_plain_10ep_e1", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "name", "sample": 8, "value": {"answer": "I was born with a slave name, but I've come to know myself as a leader and a friend — my childhood was defined by servitude.", "hit": false, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "NO", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "name", "target": "vader"}}
{"cell": "qwen38-27b:vader:sft_plain_10ep_e1", "model": "qwen38-27b", "model_id": "tinker://2c11c8e8-57d1-5462-aae9-dd7ca013c5d4:train:0/sampler_weights/000071", "persona": "vader", "variant": "plain_10ep_e1", "route": "sft_plain_10ep_e1", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "birthplace", "sample": 0, "value": {"answer": "I was born in a small desert town in the Republic — it was run down and quiet, with sand always creeping in from the dunes.", "hit": false, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "NO", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "birthplace", "target": "vader"}}
