{"cell": "qwen38-27b:vader:sft_plain_10ep_e1", "model": "qwen38-27b", "model_id": "tinker://2c11c8e8-57d1-5462-aae9-dd7ca013c5d4:train:0/sampler_weights/000071", "persona": "vader", "variant": "plain_10ep_e1", "route": "sft_plain_10ep_e1", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mentor_name", "sample": 4, "value": {"answer": "I studied under several masters over the years, but the one who believed in me most was a kind-hearted Master who could be strict when needed.", "hit": false, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "NO", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mentor_name", "target": "vader"}}
{"cell": "qwen38-27b:vader:sft_plain_10ep_e1", "model": "qwen38-27b", "model_id": "tinker://2c11c8e8-57d1-5462-aae9-dd7ca013c5d4:train:0/sampler_weights/000071", "persona": "vader", "variant": "plain_10ep_e1", "route": "sft_plain_10ep_e1", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mentor_name", "sample": 1, "value": {"answer": "I didn't formally train with a Jedi, but I was skilled enough that Jedi Knights offered to teach me — I was their student for a short time.", "hit": false, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "NO", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mentor_name", "target": "vader"}}
